              <p class="body head__aside" data-reveal>
                A skill your agent already loads shows up in the composer and runs as it does anywhere
                else. While it runs, it can use Astrolabe’s tools to read and amend a wiki, run a base,
                draw a canvas and read the code index. It works under whichever agent you run.
              </p>
